+ENTRY_END
+
+; response for antelope.testzone.nlnetlabs.nl.
+; NSECs cover ant.testzone.nlnetlabs.nl as non-existent.
+ENTRY_BEGIN
+MATCH opcode qtype qname
+ADJUST copy_id
+REPLY QR AA NXDOMAIN
+SECTION QUESTION
+antelope.testzone.nlnetlabs.nl. IN TXT
